[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_2myy3"]
script = ExtResource("6_4w352")
markedup_text = "Cut down the tree."
outcome = SubResource("Resource_f2op8")
markedup_outcome_hint = "This will leave a mark on history."
markedup_result_text = "The foxes scatter as glyphs are inscribed onto axes.

The settlers make short work of the tree. It cracks at the first touch of a blade, crumbling to the ground.

\"Now these woods are cleansed,\" the Scribe declares."

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Resource_w2hpu"]
script = ExtResource("4_3hj8v")
markedup_text = "The expedition ventures deep into the forest, following signs interpreted by The Scribe.

At last they reach a vast glade, quiet and bright beneath the canopy. Moss glows faintly in the filtered light, and the air smells of rain.

The reverie is interrupted by movement among the trees. White tails flicker, darting like stray brushstrokes in the mist. The settlers follow, until the paths twist back upon themselves.

By the time they find their way again, night has fallen. They emerge to see an old, dry tree surrounded by foxes, dozens of them, pale as moonlight. Some swear they shine faintly.

\"This place is haunted,\" says the Scribe. \"We must act before the curse spreads.\""
